<p>A solid improvement from your earlier draft! Adding the summary of the anomalous Book of Mormon gives it enough background to make it feel like there's a larger pattern that this SCP fits into, but maintains the mystery of what this place really is, why it exists, and what's actually going on with it. I like that the exploration starts off mundane (for an extradimensional portal), and I like that the weirdest effects of this place is on the people exploring it. Creepy without feeling the need to resort to people turning into bone-monsters or pools of blood or whatever. The whole piece has a great sense of things being just not quite right.<br />
+1!</p>

